799
00:36:10,751 --> 00:36:12,043
- Yeah, it's hard.
- Right.

800
00:36:12,044 --> 00:36:15,046
I mean, I don't know how to put it,
but… Hmm, like, well…

801
00:36:15,047 --> 00:36:16,006
Yeah?

802
00:36:16,007 --> 00:36:18,049
Well, I know how Sharan feels about you.

803
00:36:18,050 --> 00:36:20,385
- Mmm.
- So there's definitely that too.

804
00:36:20,386 --> 00:36:21,386
Mmm.

805
00:36:21,387 --> 00:36:22,554
And, you know,

806
00:36:22,555 --> 00:36:25,974
I think it's amazing how Rune
is so straightforward and everything,

807
00:36:25,975 --> 00:36:27,767
so it's all really complicated.

808
00:36:27,768 --> 00:36:28,769
Uh-huh, mmm.

809
00:36:30,104 --> 00:36:32,939
Right, right.
But I don't have any doubts at all.

810
00:36:32,940 --> 00:36:34,524
- Mmm.
- For real, none.

811
00:36:34,525 --> 00:36:35,568
- Yeah?
- Mmm.

812
00:36:38,070 --> 00:36:39,906
There's only one option for me.

813
00:36:40,781 --> 00:36:41,782
And honestly,

814
00:36:43,367 --> 00:36:44,493
it makes me feel

815
00:36:45,828 --> 00:36:47,371
really glad I stayed here.

816
00:36:49,415 --> 00:36:50,291
I mean that.

817
00:36:51,626 --> 00:36:53,628
I'm just gonna keep trying
and make you fall for me.

818
00:36:56,255 --> 00:36:59,007
- Leave it to me.
- I look forward to it.

819
00:36:59,008 --> 00:37:00,843
- Mmm.
- I can't wait.

820
00:37:02,136 --> 00:37:04,429
- It is what is.
- Nothing we can do about it.

821
00:37:04,430 --> 00:37:07,225
- We still have four days.
- Yeah, we still have a shot.

822
00:37:07,767 --> 00:37:10,310
All he's getting right now
is one little moment.

823
00:37:10,311 --> 00:37:11,520
- Right.
- We'll get another chance.

824
00:37:12,271 --> 00:37:14,022
- But Tai-chan, really?
- Right?

825
00:37:14,023 --> 00:37:16,317
- <i>To think they were fighting.</i>
- <i>So true.</i>

826
00:37:16,817 --> 00:37:19,153
- Can we see them?
- See 'em?

827
00:37:20,112 --> 00:37:23,740
- I think we can see them from here.
- Are they by the sauna?

828
00:37:23,741 --> 00:37:26,202
- I can't quite get a view.
- I guess not.

829
00:37:26,953 --> 00:37:29,287
Seeing them made me mad,
so I shouldn't look.

830
00:37:29,288 --> 00:37:31,748
- I hope it starts pouring.
- Lightning strikes.

831
00:37:31,749 --> 00:37:34,126
- <i>This is cute.</i>
- <i>I know.</i>

832
00:37:36,295 --> 00:37:38,171
Can I write something? Real quick.

833
00:37:38,172 --> 00:37:39,089
