835
00:37:40,633 --> 00:37:42,718
- "Big, bright star."
- "Big, bright star."

836
00:37:43,511 --> 00:37:44,762
- There we go.
- Mmm.

837
00:37:45,721 --> 00:37:47,890
- "Star." That's so cool.
- I know.

838
00:37:50,017 --> 00:37:50,851
Hmm…

839
00:37:51,978 --> 00:37:53,729
<i>This is just like a movie.</i>

840
00:37:55,314 --> 00:37:57,816
