844
00:38:03,239 --> 00:38:04,155
I LIKE MIMI SO MUCH

845
00:38:04,156 --> 00:38:06,283
- No way!
- Why not? Are you embarrassed?

846
00:38:06,284 --> 00:38:07,410
Yeah, a little.

847
00:38:08,411 --> 00:38:12,747
Well, this is how I feel.
So? Are my feelings coming across?

848
00:38:12,748 --> 00:38:14,917
- I'd say so.
- That's good.

849
00:38:16,752 --> 00:38:19,504
Sorry, I'm always too straightforward.

850
00:38:19,505 --> 00:38:22,340
- No, stop. I'm happy. I really am.
- Mmm.

851
00:38:22,341 --> 00:38:23,217
Mmm.

852
00:38:25,303 --> 00:38:27,305
I feel super blessed.

853
00:38:28,514 --> 00:38:31,017
And I wanna say
thank you for choosing to meet me.

854
00:38:33,769 --> 00:38:36,939
And my feelings aren't going to change.

855
00:38:38,941 --> 00:38:40,276
I like you so much.

856
00:38:43,946 --> 00:38:45,572
<i>Aw, that was cute!</i>

857
00:38:45,573 --> 00:38:47,199
- Sorry, I can't help myself.
- Yeah?

858
00:38:48,451 --> 00:38:49,994
- Thank you.
- Hmm.

859
00:38:53,205 --> 00:38:55,291
- Come here.
- Huh? For what?

860
00:39:03,174 --> 00:39:05,133
