864
00:39:13,392 --> 00:39:16,102
My heart was pounding.
It definitely felt like love.

865
00:39:16,103 --> 00:39:17,521
I think Tai-chan is more…

866
00:39:18,314 --> 00:39:19,647
exciting and free

867
00:39:19,648 --> 00:39:22,692
