and expresses himself around me.

868
00:39:22,693 --> 00:39:25,111
He was going to write his feelings
in the sand.

869
00:39:25,112 --> 00:39:28,948
He wrote "I like Mimi so much."
Terrible handwriting.

870
00:39:28,949 --> 00:39:30,325
He was hurt by that.

871
00:39:30,326 --> 00:39:33,703
He's cute.
When I look at his face, my heart pounds.

872
00:39:33,704 --> 00:39:37,123
To be honest, my heart
doesn't pound like that with Rune.

873
00:39:37,124 --> 00:39:39,210
But with him, I feel a sense of security.

874
00:39:41,587 --> 00:39:44,172
She was being a lot looser
than she was with Rune, wasn't she?

875
00:39:44,173 --> 00:39:46,549
- She seemed more natural.
- She seemed softer around him too.

876
00:39:46,550 --> 00:39:49,511
I found myself thinking that
they might end up together.

877
00:39:49,512 --> 00:39:51,888
- Oh!
- Tai-chan is so straightforward.

878
00:39:51,889 --> 00:39:54,474
- Yeah.
- Maybe that's kind of refreshing?

879
00:39:54,475 --> 00:39:55,683
- Yeah.
- Exactly.

880
00:39:55,684 --> 00:39:56,976
She works at a hostess club,

881
00:39:56,977 --> 00:39:59,479
so she must've learned
a lot of mind tricks.

882
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:01,231
- Ah. That's true.
- So considering that,

883
00:40:01,232 --> 00:40:03,066
wouldn't she think
Tai-chan's attitude is cute?

884
00:40:03,067 --> 00:40:04,359
"I like Mimi so much."

885
00:40:04,360 --> 00:40:06,112
- He wrote in the sand!
- Really cute!

886
00:40:07,947 --> 00:40:10,156
- Okay, I'm going.
- Enjoy.

887
00:40:10,157 --> 00:40:12,325
- I'm excited.
- Make the most of it.

888
00:40:12,326 --> 00:40:14,662
- Have fun. Show off those dimples, Rinrin.
- Shut up.

889
00:40:26,715 --> 00:40:28,758
