- Did you think I'd choose you?

894
00:40:40,104 --> 00:40:43,731
No, actually, we had no idea
who you would choose.

895
00:40:43,732 --> 00:40:45,109
But I chose you, Rinrin.

896
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:47,820
- Mmm-hmm.
- Sure did.

897
00:40:49,488 --> 00:40:51,573
So, are you worried about anything?

898
00:40:51,574 --> 00:40:53,409
- Nope, nothing.
- Nothing at all?

899
00:40:54,201 --> 00:40:55,828
