900
00:40:56,579 --> 00:40:57,996
Have you ever cheated?

901
00:40:57,997 --> 00:40:59,372
- Nope.
- Are you sure?

902
00:40:59,373 --> 00:41:02,250
No, I haven't!
Oh, that's what you're worried about?

903
00:41:02,251 --> 00:41:04,127
Yeah, a little.

904
00:41:04,128 --> 00:41:06,463
The thing is, when I get a boyfriend,

905
00:41:06,464 --> 00:41:09,132
I stop going out, like, completely.

906
00:41:09,133 --> 00:41:10,341
Mmm-hmm.

907
00:41:10,342 --> 00:41:12,135
I'm either home or with the girls.

908
00:41:12,136 --> 00:41:14,304
If I go out at all,
it's always with my female friends.

909
00:41:14,305 --> 00:41:17,515
- I've never cheated, and I couldn't.
- Right, mmm.

910
00:41:17,516 --> 00:41:19,976
I usually don't get super interested
in guys like this.

911
00:41:19,977 --> 00:41:21,311
Oh, really?

912
00:41:21,312 --> 00:41:24,898
Well, I'm glad that
you told me how you feel despite that.

913
00:41:24,899 --> 00:41:25,982
It means a lot.

914
00:41:25,983 --> 00:41:28,568
Yeah, I just don't feel this way
very often.

915
00:41:28,569 --> 00:41:30,195
- Really?
- Mmm-hmm.

916
00:41:30,196 --> 00:41:31,404
