917
00:41:31,405 --> 00:41:32,614
Yeah, I guess.

918
00:41:32,615 --> 00:41:35,408
Ryopi and I had some stuff
going on at first, though.

919
00:41:35,409 --> 00:41:36,869
- Mmm.
- Yeah.

920
00:41:37,786 --> 00:41:40,914
- Did you guys kiss? There was a rumor.
- Right, he kissed me. Mmm…

921
00:41:40,915 --> 00:41:42,541
